 [('Say how long you will have been studying English by next year.','Use FPC.','By next year, I will have been studying English for ten years.'),('Contrast FPC and Future Perfect.','Contraste.','I will have been writing for hours; I will have finished the draft.'),('Say what constrains your plans.','Use constrain.','Time constrains what I can promise.')],
