 [('Open a presentation on a topic you know.','Abra.','Today I’d like to talk about remote work.'),('Signpost a change of topic.','Sinalize.','That brings me to the costs.'),('Close the presentation.','Encerre.','To sum up, we need three decisions. I’d be happy to take questions.')],
 ('Write the script of a 6-sentence presentation: opening, two points, conclusion.','Good morning. I’d like to begin by outlining the problem with our current supplier. That brings me to my first point: delays. Let me move on to my second point: cost. What matters most is that we reach a consensus today. To sum up, we need a new supplier. I’d be happy to take questions.',['Abri e encerrei','Sinalizei as mudanças','Usei **reach a consensus**'],'6 frases'),
