 'eu consigo ler, ouvir, falar e escrever sobre uma negociadora a partir de uma biografia, usando take on e to challenge an assumption.',
 ('Reading · A short biography',bio('Maria Santos Reyes',['Maria Santos Reyes (fictional) built her career as a trade mediator in Manila. In 2008 she **took on** a dispute between fishing cooperatives and a canning company that no one else wanted. Instead of defending either side, she began **to challenge an assumption** both held: that one group’s gain must be the other’s loss.','By 2012, her model of shared quotas had been adopted by five regions. Colleagues say she **took on** hard cases because she believed trust could be rebuilt.'],years='b. 1970',facts=[('Job','mediadora comercial'),('City','Manila'),('Known for','quotas compartilhadas')],gloss=[('cooperative','cooperativa'),('quota','cota'),('adopt','adotar'),('mediator','mediador')])),
